16
00:00:30,984 --> 00:00:32,883
No order is sent from this lesson.

17
00:00:33,882 --> 00:00:35,763
Crypto is a digital coin, such

18
00:00:35,763 --> 00:00:37,566
as bitcoin, and a daily close

19
00:00:37,566 --> 00:00:39,370
is the last price of that day.

20
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,986
A band, also called the range, is

21
00:00:41,986 --> 00:00:43,999
the top and the bottom, a gap is

22
00:00:43,999 --> 00:00:46,180
